					"nextDialogs": [
						740000229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩肖"
				},
				{
					"id": 740000229,
					"content": "知道啦，<color=#00E1FFFF>要是它耍性子不肯走，把吃食拿走</color>，它肯定就会乖乖回家了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740000230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉诺尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740000230,
					"content": "知道就好。还有，<color=#00E1FFFF>可别把围墙里的花踩坏了</color>！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740000231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩肖"
				},
				{
					"id": 740000231,
					"content": "#派蒙姐姐的话，根本不用担心嘛！我和{NICKNAME}{M#哥哥}{F#姐姐}都会小心的，外公就放心好啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740000232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉诺尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740000232,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}{M#哥哥}{F#姐姐}，派蒙姐姐，我们走吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "莉诺尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740000226,
					"content": "那王子和公主不管了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740000227
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740000227,
					"content": "对哦…可是全都放进标题里的话，标题就太长啦。就当是营救勇士，顺便也带王子和公主回窝好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740000228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉诺尔"
				}
			]
		},
